            <div xml:id="preface">

                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>This volume was prepared under the direct supervision of E. Ralph Perkins,
                    formerly Chief of the Foreign Relations Division now headed by S. Everett
                    Gleason. The compilers of the volume were N. O. Sappington, John G. Reid, John
                    P. Glennon, William Slany, Velma Hastings Cassidy, and Warren H. Reynolds; and
                    former members of the Division, Douglas W. Houston, John Rison Jones, and
                    William K. Medlin.</p>
                <p>The Publishing and Reproduction Services Division (Jerome H. Perlmutter, Chief)
                    was responsible for the technical editing of this volume and the preparation of
                    the index. These functions were performed in the Historical Editing Section
                    under the direct supervision of Elizabeth A. Vary, Chief, and Ouida J. Ward,
                    Assistant Chief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> M. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Franklin</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office</hi>, <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bureau of Public Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1965-03-02"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >March</hi> 2, 1965</date></dateline></closer>


                <xi:include href="preface-a1.xml" xpointer="preface-a1"/>
